PSE&G Outlines Capital Investment Program Focused on Infrastructure Modernization and Decarbonization;

PSEG Power to Retain Nuclear Fleet; PSEG to Exit Offshore Wind Generation

NEWARK, N.J., March 9, 2023 /PRNewswire/ -- PSEG will hold its 2023 Investor Conference in New York on Friday, March 10.  PSEG Chair, President and CEO Ralph LaRossa will provide investors with an overview of the company's improved business profile resulting from several important milestones over the past 18 months to i
